From f4a1c8d70a52da96e70a04e4858ff9c81a2f63e5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Babu <nagendra.kolli@carbynetech.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 02:31:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Colour system refresh: semantic tokens, clearer status vs
 day-type colours, AA contrast

- variables.css rewritten as the single source of colour, with role tokens
  (status, day types, billing split, heat scale, sidebar/on-dark)
- Leave/Holiday/WFH no longer reuse status colours (violet/rose/teal);
  red is now only for returned/rejected/errors
- Darker page canvas + card borders so cards separate from the page
- Secondary text darkened to pass WCAG AA; smallest text raised to 11px
- All hard-coded hex/rgba values in components moved onto tokens
- Partial billable shown as light blue (was green), capacity bar under = amber
- Removed unused .glass classes that referenced undefined variables
- Frontend styling only: no API, logic or layout changes

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01LhNUa6t9pPmCezwjqzSy7j
